{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_004_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e3f4cb1fb41e17015447c9fe2ee18927148ec18b092528a1ff3b1f184ed5399c", "ja": "うっ！　……わ、わかってる、歌だよね。……いや、\nちゃんとレッスンしてるよ？　いっぱい怒られるけど。", "zh": "唔！……我、我知道，是唱歌对吧。……不对，\n我有好好练习哦？虽然经常被狠狠训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_004_1039_p", "source_sha256": "694cd619a6b8501a87345ccba6aa6d0d5b936effd79e993d2a54082a8ab47fb1", "ja": "……聞いてるよ。そうみたいだな。\nやっぱり当面の課題は歌か……。", "zh": "……我听说了。好像确实是这样啊。\n果然眼下的课题还是唱歌吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
